       "en": "To say yes, show some excitement: **“I’d love to!”**, **“Count me in!”**, **“Sounds fun! What can I bring?”**. That last question is very important. In the US, guests almost always offer to bring something, even if the host says “Just bring yourself!”. A bottle of wine, a dessert, chips and salsa, or flowers are all good choices.",
