       "en": "Some modern words: if someone reads your message and doesn’t answer, you were **left on read**. If they stop answering completely, forever, they **ghosted** you. These are casual words, often used with humor: **“Did you just leave me on read?? 😂”**. On Instagram or Facebook, you can **post** photos, **tag** friends in them, **comment**, and send a **DM** (a private message).",
