       "en": "For **wh- questions** (what, where, when, why, how), keep the question word and use normal order: “What time does the party start?” → **“He wanted to know what time the party started.”** “Where do you live?” → **“She asked where I lived.”** A common mistake is keeping the question form: ✗ “She asked where did I live.” → ✓ **“She asked where I lived.”** This is the same structure as polite questions: “Do you know where the restroom is?”",
