         "why": "*Happy holidays!* works for everyone because not everybody celebrates Christmas. *Vacations* is a false friend: it means time off from work.",
         "whyFr": "*Happy holidays!* convient à tous car tout le monde ne fête pas Noël. *Vacations* est un faux ami : ce sont des congés.",
